<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6062] Internal Table Metadata Not Deleted After Project Deletion Causes Tables to Remain Visible in a Re-created Project with the Same Name</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6062</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Project 44179 exists with internal tables loaded. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;After deleting project 44179, the metadata for the loaded internal tables still remains. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;When recreating project 44179 and enabling internal tables, the previously loaded internal tables still appear on the internal table page.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
